<html>
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<title>Password Reset</title>
	</head>
	<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px;">
		<table width="100%" max-width="600px" style="margin: auto; background: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
			<tr>
				<td>
					<p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
					<p>You requested to reset your password. Click the button below to proceed:</p>

					<div>
						<p>Your reset token:</p>
						<p style="font-weight: bold;">{{token}}</p>
					</div>

					<p style="color: #999;">
						⚠️ This code will expire in
						<strong>10 minutes</strong>.
					</p>

					<p>If you did not request this, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

					<br />
					<p>BookWorm Support Team</p>
				</td>
			</tr>
		</table>
	</body>
</html>